<p>Baqar(a.s) Yateem Hogaye Sajjad(a.s) Margaye<br />
Bewea Janaabe dukhtar e shabbar(a.s) ko kargaye</p>

<p>1. Waris Bayaan karte hain ro ro ke raat din<br />
Hum Bekasou'n ko chordh ke hazrath kidhar gaye</p>

<p>2. Duniya me koi puchne waala nahi raha<br />
Kyun kar na hum jahaan se ya rab guzar gaye</p>

<p>3. Mar jaaye sarparast to kya lutfe zindagi<br />
Hum Badnaseeb mout se pehle na margaye</p>

<p>4. Be wariso ka marna hi acch hai jeene se<br />
Jab bekasi me monis o ghamkhwaar margaye</p>

<p>5. Hazrat se koi puchta rone ka jab sabab<br />
Kehte the hum yateem hue baap margaye</p>